      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "When it re-opened in 1933 following the repeal of Prohibition, it was one of the first establishments to receive a liquor license in the state of Washington.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
